\solution{\name_sol:
<div class="wimscenter">\pourtout \(n\geq 0\) \name_and \name_real  \(r\neq 1\), \(\displaystyle{\sum_{\ell=0}^{n}r^\ell = \frac{1-r^{n+1}}{1-r}}\).</div>}

